dicated in this game, it just becomes incredibly repetitive which kind of ruins the fun in this underrated roguelike game after some time. Also, please fix the languages that are Chinese letters by default to the ones we have selected in the settings because everytime I see that, I have to decrypt them using google translate everytime lol. In summary, this game is amazing with little downsides. One of my favorite games.", "timestamp_created": 1782832941, "timestamp_updated": 1782832941, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229208202", "author": {"steamid": "76561198127635213", "personaname": "LunchBox", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198127635213/", "num_games_owned": 245, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 768, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 424, "last_played": 1782857725, "avatar": "53fdeefe4a627910c7945c2e97456e178e59fe62"}, "language": "english", "review": "fans of hades and destiny have this game in common. fun rouge like with quick replay ability.", "timestamp_created": 1782788531, "timestamp_updated": 1782788531, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}]}